WEBVTT

01:38.560 --> 01:41.840
BASED ON THE NOVEL
"THE PRISONER OF BEAUTY" BY PENGLAI KE

01:48.200 --> 01:49.720
Do you blame me?

01:50.920 --> 01:52.200
Why would you say that?

01:52.920 --> 01:54.600
When you were at home,

01:54.680 --> 01:56.680
you were treasured like a jewel.

01:57.400 --> 01:59.880
But in Wei State,
you're cautious all the time.

02:01.280 --> 02:03.400
Wei State is not a cage,

02:03.920 --> 02:05.920
but for you, it's no different.

02:07.120 --> 02:09.840
I've never seen you so at ease before.

02:11.360 --> 02:12.720
It's my fault.

02:14.160 --> 02:15.680
You treat me well.

02:16.680 --> 02:18.680
My days with you

02:18.760 --> 02:20.080
are comfortable and happy.

02:23.280 --> 02:24.120
Then it's settled.

02:24.600 --> 02:26.080
Kangjun is your home,

02:26.840 --> 02:27.680
and Yujun

02:27.760 --> 02:29.080
is also your home.

02:33.000 --> 02:33.720
Let's go.

02:43.360 --> 02:45.840
This used to be my favorite place.

02:47.400 --> 02:49.800
In summer, the trees grow thick and full.

02:50.720 --> 02:53.560
I would dance
as Cousin played the konghou.

02:54.560 --> 02:57.240
Those days seem long gone now.

02:58.360 --> 02:59.280
Maybe

03:00.400 --> 03:01.360
some still linger.

03:19.800 --> 03:21.800
You're really lucky today.

03:22.400 --> 03:23.880
Cousin feels like playing again.

03:25.000 --> 03:27.120
Her konghou is of exquisite craftsmanship.

03:27.880 --> 03:28.720
How about this?

03:29.280 --> 03:30.280
I'll play a piece for you.

03:31.600 --> 03:32.920
No need today.

03:33.000 --> 03:34.080
I've heard you play before.

03:34.680 --> 03:37.280
Spend some time with your cousin today.

03:37.360 --> 03:38.160
I'll go for a stroll.

03:53.320 --> 03:54.320
Manman!

04:11.280 --> 04:12.400
Don't get up.

04:19.399 --> 04:21.279
You're with child now.

04:22.480 --> 04:25.240
How could you come
all the way out here alone?

04:25.600 --> 04:27.560
Do you still see yourself as a young miss?

04:28.720 --> 04:30.360
Soon, you'll be a mother.

04:43.240 --> 04:44.920
We've been apart for so long.

04:45.680 --> 04:47.640
Meeting here in Kangjun is a rare chance,

04:48.280 --> 04:50.200
so I came early to wait for you.

04:55.240 --> 04:57.120
Cousin, if ever you miss me,

04:58.040 --> 04:59.760
just come back anytime you want.

05:19.280 --> 05:20.840
When I left,

05:20.920 --> 05:22.680
I didn't bring this konghou with me.

05:23.400 --> 05:24.520
But now,

05:25.560 --> 05:27.280
my fingers itch to play.

05:30.240 --> 05:31.080
It's perfect.

05:33.120 --> 05:35.320
I would be delighted to hear you play.

05:40.400 --> 05:41.960
I would be glad if you don't mind.

08:02.000 --> 08:02.840
What's wrong?

08:03.920 --> 08:04.920
Manman and I

08:06.040 --> 08:07.680
feel distant now.

08:10.160 --> 08:11.160
It'll be all right.

08:20.600 --> 08:23.000
Why do you look so downcast?

08:24.600 --> 08:26.040
I just feel

08:26.560 --> 08:28.480
Cousin and I are no longer
as we once were.

08:29.640 --> 08:31.280
That day in Xindu,

08:31.360 --> 08:32.919
when Yanzhou was under siege,

08:33.000 --> 08:34.240
I went to her for help.

08:35.320 --> 08:36.520
She told me…

08:37.480 --> 08:39.120
You know it's dangerous up ahead.

08:39.200 --> 08:40.960
Are you going to send him to die?

08:41.840 --> 08:43.520
You are capable and responsible.

08:43.600 --> 08:45.640
You can save the people of the realm.

08:45.720 --> 08:46.920
But I'm different.

08:47.000 --> 08:48.360
I'm just an ordinary woman

08:48.440 --> 08:50.760
with no ambition and no grand vision.

08:51.320 --> 08:52.520
Even if I give it my all,

08:52.600 --> 08:55.160
I can only protect one person.

08:55.240 --> 08:56.880
I'm not like you,

08:56.960 --> 09:00.240
who pushes her husband fight and die
for the Qiao clan,

09:00.320 --> 09:02.600
and for the people of Yanzhou!

09:03.600 --> 09:06.360
I… I can't do it.

09:07.840 --> 09:09.520
Did I make a mistake?

09:10.840 --> 09:12.640
Even Cousin knew

09:12.720 --> 09:14.400
not to want her husband
to take such risks.

09:15.480 --> 09:18.480
But I pushed you, pressured you,
and even schemed against you.

09:18.560 --> 09:22.120
I've been so afraid that
you'd think the same.

09:22.200 --> 09:23.880
That I care nothing for your safety.

09:25.320 --> 09:26.840
In that situation,

09:27.320 --> 09:28.600
you had no other choice.

09:30.360 --> 09:31.520
Besides, I know…

09:34.080 --> 09:35.120
my Manman

09:36.040 --> 09:37.440
is not like other women.

09:37.960 --> 09:39.280
She loves me,

09:39.360 --> 09:40.240
her family,

09:41.320 --> 09:42.520
and the people even more.

09:43.520 --> 09:44.880
So you did nothing wrong.

09:46.320 --> 09:47.160
Also,

09:47.720 --> 09:49.440
I'd love to be your spear and shield,

09:50.000 --> 09:51.080
to fight for you,

09:51.440 --> 09:52.320
to guard your path,

09:53.000 --> 09:54.520
to make your every wish

09:55.080 --> 09:56.280
come true.

10:11.360 --> 10:12.760
I have one more wish.

10:14.840 --> 10:15.720
What is it?

10:30.360 --> 10:31.280
"May you be safe and sound."

10:33.240 --> 10:36.200
You just said you would make
all my wishes come true.

10:37.280 --> 10:39.760
All I wish is for you
to be safe and sound.

10:39.840 --> 10:41.640
Don't worry. I will be.

11:15.360 --> 11:16.720
You startled me.

11:18.520 --> 11:19.360
Over there.

11:25.880 --> 11:27.680
- Feel free to have a look.
- Thank you.

11:31.600 --> 11:32.440
It's beautiful.

11:32.960 --> 11:33.840
Isn't it?

11:34.840 --> 11:36.720
- Does it look good?
- It does.

11:36.800 --> 11:37.840
It really does.

11:38.720 --> 11:40.360
See? It looks just like you.

11:44.320 --> 11:45.160
This one?

11:45.240 --> 11:45.920
Like me?

11:46.000 --> 11:47.320
This chubby little thing
is exactly like you.

11:54.240 --> 11:55.320
What's wrong?

11:56.360 --> 11:57.720
I'll keep my distance.

11:58.000 --> 11:59.600
I'm chubby. I don't want to crowd you.

12:01.760 --> 12:03.200
It's cheerful and bright.

12:17.600 --> 12:18.400
Everyone,

12:18.480 --> 12:21.040
you've fled far and suffered much.

12:21.120 --> 12:22.120
For now,

12:22.480 --> 12:24.520
please settle here.

12:24.600 --> 12:25.480
Stay warm and well-fed.

12:25.560 --> 12:27.520
Prefect, that's so kind of you!

12:27.600 --> 12:28.680
Prefect, that's so kind of you.

12:28.760 --> 12:32.240
- I never thought he'd gave us shelter.
- Exactly.

12:32.320 --> 12:33.440
Prefect, you're so kind.

12:33.520 --> 12:35.440
He doesn't look down on us Liangya people.

12:35.520 --> 12:36.480
Exactly.

12:36.560 --> 12:40.280
In the days ahead,
we'll do what we can for you, Prefect.

12:41.120 --> 12:43.120
Thank you, Prefect.

12:43.200 --> 12:45.040
No need for formality.

12:45.120 --> 12:47.200
Please rise.

12:51.240 --> 12:52.480
Distribute the food.

12:52.880 --> 12:53.680
Mother.

12:53.760 --> 12:54.640
This is for you.

12:54.720 --> 12:55.600
You eat that.

13:00.600 --> 13:01.440
Prefect,

13:02.000 --> 13:03.920
our food was already scarce after the war.

13:04.000 --> 13:05.840
Now, I fear we won't hold out much longer.

13:11.080 --> 13:12.080
Pass my order.

13:13.320 --> 13:14.280
Stop all wine brewing.

13:14.880 --> 13:17.120
We should save the grain first.

13:17.840 --> 13:18.680
Yes.

13:32.960 --> 13:35.440
GRAIN

13:35.520 --> 13:36.480
Your Lordship.

13:37.960 --> 13:39.240
May I ask why you are here,

13:40.880 --> 13:42.520
and what this is for?

13:42.600 --> 13:45.280
These are military supplies
I brought to Kangjun.

13:45.360 --> 13:47.040
I hope they will be helpful.

13:47.520 --> 13:50.640
Also, grain from Xindu
will arrive in a few days.

13:52.320 --> 13:55.720
Your Lordship, you've lifted
a great burden from us!

13:58.000 --> 14:01.040
On behalf of the people,
I thank Your Lordship.

14:01.120 --> 14:01.960
Please rise.

14:04.160 --> 14:05.240
No need for formality.

14:06.200 --> 14:08.000
Although you thank me,

14:08.080 --> 14:10.440
there's something I want to ask you.

14:12.240 --> 14:15.360
Because of Liangya,
Yanzhou lies in ruins now.

14:16.000 --> 14:18.880
Why do you shelter
these stragglers and refugees?

14:19.240 --> 14:20.080
Moreover,

14:20.160 --> 14:22.760
some of them may have fought
against you in Liancheng.

14:30.320 --> 14:33.440
These common folk are war-torn innocents.

14:33.520 --> 14:35.720
They are pitiful souls with nowhere to go.

14:36.960 --> 14:39.360
Does it really matter
where they come from?

14:41.480 --> 14:42.440
Who among them

14:43.080 --> 14:44.440
ever wished for war?

14:45.600 --> 14:47.600
They had no choice.

14:52.920 --> 14:56.600
You built canals for the realm

14:57.200 --> 14:58.560
and gave up troops.

14:58.640 --> 15:01.840
You never asked who helped or opposed you,

15:03.600 --> 15:06.320
nor cared about past kindness or grudges.

15:07.600 --> 15:09.360
You did it for the people, and so do I.

15:11.600 --> 15:12.760
That's true.

15:16.200 --> 15:17.560
If peace ever comes

15:19.080 --> 15:21.080
one day,

15:22.200 --> 15:23.960
I'll guard it with all my heart

15:25.120 --> 15:27.360
and ensure it lasts for generations.

15:28.760 --> 15:31.120
Even if peace lasts only for a moment,

15:32.320 --> 15:35.920
a sincere heart can make its echo
last for generations.

15:42.080 --> 15:43.480
If every region

15:44.120 --> 15:46.320
followed Your Lordship's example,

15:47.160 --> 15:48.680
then true sincerity

15:48.760 --> 15:50.160
could dissolve hatred

15:50.640 --> 15:53.240
and bring peace to the land.

15:55.120 --> 15:56.400
I will stand by your side,

15:56.480 --> 15:58.080
helping to complete the canal,

15:58.360 --> 15:59.640
facing hardships together,

15:59.720 --> 16:01.040
bringing water to all regions,

16:01.120 --> 16:02.360
ending wars,

16:03.080 --> 16:05.360
and dissolving hatred
with genuine sincerity,

16:05.440 --> 16:06.840
to bring peace to the whole realm.

16:12.840 --> 16:14.240
I hope that day will come.

16:17.240 --> 16:18.600
At the end of the day,

16:19.120 --> 16:21.000
since they've come to Yanzhou,

16:21.080 --> 16:23.760
I can't simply watch them starve.

16:24.600 --> 16:27.680
But I'm sorry for causing you trouble.

16:27.760 --> 16:32.200
You shouldn't have burdened
Wei State because of this.

16:33.520 --> 16:34.440
You're welcome.

16:35.200 --> 16:38.040
In chaotic times,
the people are the most innocent.

16:38.120 --> 16:40.240
Father, we share the same intention,

16:40.320 --> 16:41.760
so I wish to help.

16:47.360 --> 16:48.240
What did you call me?

16:49.640 --> 16:50.600
I called you Father.

16:55.000 --> 16:56.640
It's been a while
since I married Her Ladyship,

16:56.720 --> 16:58.040
but the journey's been rough.

16:58.120 --> 17:00.160
Only now do I get to speak with you.

17:00.640 --> 17:03.400
Your heart is with the people,
just like Her Ladyship's.

17:04.079 --> 17:07.880
Father, I hope you don't mind
my being late.

17:11.240 --> 17:14.240
I don't deserve to have
Your Lordship do this.

17:14.319 --> 17:18.480
This gesture is not from the Lord of Wei
to the Prefect of Yanzhou.

17:18.560 --> 17:20.599
It's from a son-in-law
to his father-in-law.

17:46.240 --> 17:47.760
Zhonglin, you show such respect.

17:49.000 --> 17:51.520
I feel all the more

17:52.680 --> 17:54.000
uneasy and ashamed.

17:55.160 --> 17:57.040
We're family.
There's no need to be so formal.

18:02.440 --> 18:04.240
The night banquet is about to begin.

18:04.320 --> 18:06.600
Let's go together, Father.

18:08.800 --> 18:09.640
Of course.

18:09.720 --> 18:10.440
Of course.

18:11.440 --> 18:12.280
This way, please.

18:18.640 --> 18:20.560
Zhonglin holds no grudge.

18:21.920 --> 18:23.400
But our Qiao clan

18:24.160 --> 18:26.480
still owes the Wei clan a great debt.

18:30.480 --> 18:31.320
Father,

18:32.320 --> 18:34.680
I'd like to offer you a toast
on behalf of Her Ladyship.

18:34.760 --> 18:36.040
Thank you for raising her.

18:37.280 --> 18:39.120
Speaking of raising her…

18:39.680 --> 18:40.880
Right.

18:40.960 --> 18:44.480
Yue and Lady Ding
have treated Manman as their own,

18:45.400 --> 18:46.480
especially Lady Ding.

18:47.480 --> 18:50.320
She deserves this toast from Zhonglin.

19:04.200 --> 19:06.360
Mother, I'd like to offer you a toast.

19:07.200 --> 19:09.680
Thank you for raising Fan.

19:16.960 --> 19:18.000
Lord of…

19:18.480 --> 19:19.400
Zhonglin.

19:19.480 --> 19:21.000
Here's to the rebuilding
of the Yongning Canal.

19:26.200 --> 19:27.040
Everyone,

19:27.640 --> 19:28.800
raise your cups.

19:30.920 --> 19:31.760
To the canal.

19:41.040 --> 19:42.160
Although

19:42.760 --> 19:44.680
you are Manman's uncle,

19:45.440 --> 19:48.160
Yanzhou and Wei State lie between us.

19:48.960 --> 19:51.320
You'd better address me
as the Lord of Wei.

19:53.760 --> 19:54.960
The Lord of Wei…

19:56.240 --> 19:58.680
Zhonglin means to speak to me as family,

19:58.760 --> 20:00.600
and to you as an official.

20:00.680 --> 20:01.760
It doesn't conflict.

20:10.200 --> 20:12.040
Um, well, Bi Zhi.

20:17.960 --> 20:18.800
Governor.

20:19.480 --> 20:20.400
You should call me Father.

20:22.480 --> 20:23.240
Father.

20:24.640 --> 20:27.880
I've heard you have repeatedly
defeated Xue Tai.

20:27.960 --> 20:29.680
You're pretty talented.

20:29.760 --> 20:32.000
We're short on generals in Yanzhou.

20:32.960 --> 20:35.200
Seems you're destined
to join the Qiao family.

20:36.640 --> 20:38.000
Governor, you flatter me.

20:38.080 --> 20:38.960
Call me Father.

20:40.160 --> 20:41.160
Father.

20:41.640 --> 20:43.600
Though I've fought Xue Tai a few times,

20:44.200 --> 20:45.880
I'm just a groom.

20:47.120 --> 20:49.880
I know little beyond that.
I merely scraped by.

20:50.800 --> 20:53.200
Fan once said Xue Tai feared

20:53.280 --> 20:54.560
the Lord of Wei and Her Ladyship,

20:55.000 --> 20:56.640
so he never attacked me head-on.

20:59.320 --> 21:00.280
To the Lord of Wei.

21:02.400 --> 21:03.320
Cheers.

21:13.240 --> 21:16.400
Now that you and Fan
have both returned home,

21:16.480 --> 21:18.320
settle in properly.

21:18.400 --> 21:19.880
I'll send someone to take over Boya.

21:23.080 --> 21:24.160
Thank you, Father.

21:24.240 --> 21:26.840
Do you truly accept Fan and me now?

21:27.400 --> 21:29.000
Boya is just a small place.

21:29.080 --> 21:30.960
Bi Zhi can still manage it well.

21:31.040 --> 21:33.320
Besides, I've grown used to it.

21:33.400 --> 21:34.720
We will return someday.

21:35.680 --> 21:37.120
That's our real home.

21:47.240 --> 21:50.360
Manman asked for your help,
but you refused?

21:50.440 --> 21:52.880
No wonder Wei Shao
keeps his distance from me.

21:54.280 --> 21:55.920
Father, don't worry.

21:56.000 --> 21:57.360
The Lord of Wei holds no grudge.

21:57.440 --> 21:59.200
He's still willing to be Bi Zhi's in-law.

21:59.280 --> 22:00.480
You're too naïve.

22:01.640 --> 22:05.120
He's only being polite
because Bi Zhi is useful.

22:08.080 --> 22:11.720
I explained the pros and cons to Manman.

22:11.800 --> 22:15.800
I didn't want Bi Zhi
risking his life to help them.

22:15.880 --> 22:17.640
Manman understood.

22:21.320 --> 22:23.240
Daughters often grow distant
after marriage.

22:24.760 --> 22:26.240
Daughters of others

22:26.320 --> 22:28.560
know to stand with their kin.

22:29.400 --> 22:31.680
Mine ran off with a mere groom.

22:34.120 --> 22:35.200
At the crucial moment,

22:35.280 --> 22:37.360
you turn your back on your family for him!

22:45.480 --> 22:46.320
Father,

22:47.680 --> 22:50.200
Bi Zhi is no longer a groom.

22:50.280 --> 22:51.320
I know.

22:52.240 --> 22:54.160
He's now the Commander of the Boya Forces.

22:55.000 --> 22:57.840
The so-called forces
are just a ragtag army.

22:57.920 --> 22:59.800
And you think it's a fine title?

23:08.600 --> 23:10.040
Go tell Bi Zhi,

23:10.520 --> 23:12.400
I'll take over Boya.

23:12.480 --> 23:15.600
He will train my cavalry
and raise my steeds.

23:16.160 --> 23:18.240
He should back up Ci

23:18.920 --> 23:21.720
so no one dares trample on me.

23:29.560 --> 23:30.320
I refuse.

23:34.240 --> 23:35.320
What did you say?

23:36.760 --> 23:39.400
Father, since you still see Bi Zhi
as a stableman,

23:39.480 --> 23:42.040
I suppose you'll never accept him
as your son-in-law.

23:42.760 --> 23:44.800
I'll live in seclusion
with Bi Zhi at Boya.

23:45.320 --> 23:47.680
Let's not interfere with each other.
Wouldn't that be better?

23:48.240 --> 23:49.320
You…

23:50.880 --> 23:52.800
Do you even hear yourself?

23:54.520 --> 23:56.560
To you, I'm just a daughter

23:56.640 --> 23:58.560
who ran off with a groom.

24:00.080 --> 24:02.160
When Bi Zhi and I were in real danger,

24:02.240 --> 24:04.680
you didn't send a single soldier
to help us.

24:05.000 --> 24:07.600
But now that Bi Zhi's gaining power,

24:07.680 --> 24:09.480
you want to use me to use him?

24:10.080 --> 24:11.240
I won't let that happen.

24:12.400 --> 24:13.120
Also,

24:14.680 --> 24:18.800
Bi Zhi not coming to fight against Liu Yan
was my decision.

24:20.160 --> 24:22.000
The Qiaos never lent him aid.

24:22.080 --> 24:24.560
I could not let him
risk his life for my family.

24:24.640 --> 24:26.920
Manman never blamed me for this.

24:27.280 --> 24:29.240
Governor, you have even less right to!

24:35.400 --> 24:39.000
I am unfilial to Mother,

24:39.080 --> 24:40.920
and I may have wronged my cousins,

24:41.920 --> 24:42.960
but, Father,

24:43.920 --> 24:46.240
I owe you nothing.

24:46.800 --> 24:47.920
- You…
- Governor!

25:05.000 --> 25:06.640
If you wish to claim Boya as your own,

25:09.000 --> 25:10.640
send your troops and take it by force.

25:39.760 --> 25:40.440
My lord.

25:40.520 --> 25:41.680
Mr. Zhang,

25:42.720 --> 25:43.560
look at me now.

25:43.640 --> 25:44.880
Do I look like a patriarch to you?

25:46.560 --> 25:49.200
Both ladies are now backed
by powerful husbands.

25:49.720 --> 25:51.560
They're no longer easy to control.

25:53.000 --> 25:56.360
But I believe both of them
still hold loyalty

25:56.440 --> 25:57.600
toward Yanzhou.

25:58.040 --> 26:00.480
They're loyal to Yanzhou, but not to me!

26:06.320 --> 26:07.160
Tell me,

26:07.960 --> 26:09.520
what caused all of this?

26:11.800 --> 26:12.640
My lord,

26:13.520 --> 26:16.360
refugees have been flooding
into Kangjun lately.

26:20.000 --> 26:22.000
The prefect's reputation

26:23.040 --> 26:24.520
may now outshine your own.

26:58.480 --> 26:59.280
What's wrong?

27:02.760 --> 27:03.600
Fan,

27:04.880 --> 27:07.520
you'd defy your father for me.

27:09.440 --> 27:10.560
That saddens me

27:11.480 --> 27:12.720
but also makes me happy.

27:14.640 --> 27:15.960
You fool.

27:16.240 --> 27:17.440
I'm not defying him.

27:17.920 --> 27:20.880
Father has always bullied the weak
and feared the strong.

27:20.960 --> 27:22.680
I won't blindly obey him

27:22.760 --> 27:24.120
just because he raised me.

27:25.520 --> 27:26.720
Remember this.

27:26.800 --> 27:28.520
In this realm,

27:28.600 --> 27:31.640
no one can use me to control you.

27:33.400 --> 27:35.560
Fan, I'm not scared.

27:36.280 --> 27:38.720
Everything I've done
was for your happiness.

27:40.000 --> 27:42.040
Being with you makes me happiest.

27:45.960 --> 27:48.600
I only hate myself
for not giving you the honor

27:49.640 --> 27:51.080
that the Lord of Wei can.

27:53.680 --> 27:57.240
If I cared about that,
I wouldn't have left with you.

28:02.000 --> 28:03.000
What I care about

28:04.400 --> 28:06.000
is your honest heart.

28:20.160 --> 28:21.400
Sour plums.

28:22.880 --> 28:24.680
That's exactly what I wanted.

28:25.760 --> 28:26.920
It's cold outside.

28:27.720 --> 28:28.680
Let's go inside.

28:39.560 --> 28:40.960
I love this room.

28:41.720 --> 28:43.040
It's filled with your scent.

28:43.120 --> 28:46.200
It just smells like your wine now.

28:48.040 --> 28:49.040
Does it?

29:05.520 --> 29:07.000
Can you still smell it?

29:10.400 --> 29:11.200
You cheeky rogue.

29:25.000 --> 29:26.600
We're returning to Wei State tomorrow.

29:28.880 --> 29:30.400
Is there anything else

29:30.480 --> 29:32.000
you'd still like to do?

29:32.680 --> 29:33.520
Tell me.

29:34.400 --> 29:36.760
I'll go with you at first light.

29:41.680 --> 29:43.280
There's nothing else.

29:46.080 --> 29:47.920
I never imagined a day like this

29:48.800 --> 29:50.880
before I married you.

30:00.240 --> 30:02.640
You weren't just pretending to be happy

30:02.720 --> 30:04.640
for my sake, were you?

30:09.760 --> 30:11.440
If I said I was,

30:13.040 --> 30:14.040
you wouldn't believe me.

30:16.240 --> 30:19.280
Then if you want to make it up to me,

30:20.520 --> 30:21.440
how about

30:22.280 --> 30:23.520
we strike a deal?

30:26.360 --> 30:28.600
Whatever you want, say it now.

30:29.880 --> 30:31.520
If it's something I can do,

30:32.640 --> 30:33.800
I'll give it my all.

30:38.760 --> 30:39.680
How about…

30:42.480 --> 30:43.680
giving me a child?

30:48.640 --> 30:50.480
You want a child from me?

30:50.960 --> 30:52.480
What do you mean, from you?

30:53.280 --> 30:54.680
It would be our child.

30:56.560 --> 30:57.640
And…

31:00.760 --> 31:01.800
I want it now.

31:09.520 --> 31:11.360
I promise I'll give you a new home,

31:13.800 --> 31:16.160
one filled with children and joy.

32:18.680 --> 32:21.840
KANGJUN

32:21.920 --> 32:23.120
There's not much time.

32:23.200 --> 32:24.960
You still need to hurry back to Yujun.

32:25.040 --> 32:26.400
I won't insist on keeping you.

32:27.320 --> 32:28.840
I only hope that next time,

32:28.920 --> 32:30.480
you'll stay a little longer.

32:37.360 --> 32:38.480
Governor, you're so kind.

32:42.040 --> 32:43.160
Father,

32:43.240 --> 32:44.600
we'll take our leave.

32:44.680 --> 32:46.880
Please take care of your health.

32:53.000 --> 32:55.560
May I have a word with you?

32:57.480 --> 32:58.160
Of course.

33:13.480 --> 33:15.080
Is this the direction to Wei State?

33:19.000 --> 33:19.840
That's right.

33:26.400 --> 33:27.800
- Father…
- Father.

34:21.920 --> 34:23.800
On behalf of the Qiao clan,

34:25.120 --> 34:26.520
I bow from afar

34:27.920 --> 34:31.480
to the spirits of the late Lord of Wei,

34:32.120 --> 34:34.159
your late father, and your late brother.

34:35.000 --> 34:36.840
I don't dare to seek forgiveness.

34:37.600 --> 34:39.400
I only wish to express
my deepest gratitude.

34:40.920 --> 34:42.400
I'm grateful to Lady Xu

34:43.400 --> 34:44.560
and Lord of Wei

34:45.520 --> 34:46.719
for your magnanimity.

34:48.080 --> 34:50.360
Back then, at the Battle of Xindu,

34:51.000 --> 34:52.560
it was the Qiao clan's fault.

34:55.040 --> 34:57.520
We brought disaster upon your kin.

34:58.680 --> 35:00.160
I feel deep remorse.

35:01.480 --> 35:02.720
My guilt is beyond words.

35:12.840 --> 35:14.120
The grudge between our families

35:15.000 --> 35:16.160
was settled long ago

35:17.640 --> 35:18.720
by my grandmother.

35:20.000 --> 35:21.800
You bear no resentment,

35:22.480 --> 35:24.160
but I cannot pretend to forget.

35:25.960 --> 35:27.400
All I ever wanted

35:27.480 --> 35:31.760
was for Manman to marry someone she loved.

35:32.400 --> 35:34.360
A man who would cherish her

35:34.440 --> 35:36.080
and live a peaceful life with her.

35:36.160 --> 35:37.720
But fate had other plans.

35:38.120 --> 35:39.720
On my late father's deathbed,

35:39.800 --> 35:41.040
he took advantage of the situation

35:42.120 --> 35:43.760
and arranged this marriage with you.

35:45.760 --> 35:47.280
If the Qiaos and the Weis

35:47.360 --> 35:49.000
had traded places,

35:49.480 --> 35:50.400
I must admit

35:51.480 --> 35:54.600
I wouldn't have treated
an enemy's daughter kindly.

35:55.680 --> 35:58.920
But Lady Xu
has been gracious and generous.

35:59.680 --> 36:01.360
She has cared deeply for my daughter.

36:02.160 --> 36:03.640
You didn't turn her away.

36:05.000 --> 36:06.520
You've shown her great care.

36:06.600 --> 36:08.000
Even for her single request,

36:09.160 --> 36:10.680
you dropped everything

36:10.760 --> 36:12.400
to personally escort her home

36:13.320 --> 36:15.680
and stepped into Yanzhou.

36:17.960 --> 36:19.600
That made me all the more ashamed.

36:20.960 --> 36:23.440
Now I see that all my doubts

36:24.200 --> 36:25.920
came from judging you

36:26.840 --> 36:28.200
by my own narrow heart.

36:29.440 --> 36:30.280
Father,

36:31.760 --> 36:32.840
I'm ashamed as well.

36:34.440 --> 36:35.520
I, too,

36:36.400 --> 36:37.480
once made things difficult

36:38.200 --> 36:39.480
and treated Her Ladyship harshly.

36:41.440 --> 36:43.360
When did you ever treat me harshly?

36:50.120 --> 36:51.560
I'm just a man of little worth.

36:51.960 --> 36:53.200
Life and death, honor and shame,

36:53.280 --> 36:54.840
they're fleeting to me.

36:55.920 --> 36:57.400
All I care about

36:58.440 --> 36:59.600
is my daughter.

37:01.520 --> 37:03.600
Today, I'd like to take this chance

37:04.080 --> 37:06.080
to entrust Manman to you,
the Lord of Wei.

37:06.800 --> 37:08.400
Please protect her

37:09.320 --> 37:11.520
and let her live a life of joy.

37:12.320 --> 37:15.240
Here and now,
I offer you my sincere gratitude.

37:17.920 --> 37:18.760
Father,

37:19.640 --> 37:20.760
you have my word.

37:21.160 --> 37:23.440
From now on,
I will cherish Manman even more.

37:24.360 --> 37:25.320
Please,

37:26.520 --> 37:27.320
trust me.

37:29.400 --> 37:30.160
I trust you.

37:31.120 --> 37:31.960
I really do.

37:55.960 --> 37:59.040
YUJUN, WEI STATE

37:59.120 --> 38:02.480
WEI MANSION, WEI STATE

38:02.560 --> 38:07.080
My lady, these are the ceremonial items
prepared for tomorrow's memorial rite.

38:07.160 --> 38:08.240
Please take a look.

38:08.320 --> 38:09.720
GIFT LIST OF THE MEMORIAL RITE

38:09.800 --> 38:11.040
His Lordship won a great battle

38:11.120 --> 38:12.400
and honors his father and brother.

38:12.480 --> 38:14.440
You've worked so hard for this,

38:14.520 --> 38:17.760
but will you be allowed to attend
and step into the ancestral hall?

38:17.840 --> 38:19.360
Forget it.

38:19.440 --> 38:21.320
Back when we first arrived in Yujun,

38:21.400 --> 38:23.240
we were left outside of the city gates

38:23.320 --> 38:25.480
just to avoid taking part
in this very rite.

38:26.880 --> 38:28.800
According to tradition,

38:28.880 --> 38:32.000
a new wife who hasn't paid her respects
at her husband's ancestral hall

38:33.120 --> 38:35.120
is not accepted
or recognized by the family.

38:37.760 --> 38:39.040
Whether they accept me or not

38:39.120 --> 38:41.360
depends on His Lordship's attitude.

38:42.080 --> 38:43.320
Besides,

38:44.000 --> 38:45.920
to ask Grandmother, Mother,
and His Lordship

38:46.000 --> 38:48.520
to let me into the ancestral hall

38:49.080 --> 38:50.880
is asking too much, isn't it?

38:51.480 --> 38:53.560
Why bring trouble upon myself?

38:56.840 --> 38:57.720
My lady,

38:57.800 --> 38:59.960
this was rushed by His Lordship's orders.

39:00.040 --> 39:01.400
He reminded them again and again,

39:01.480 --> 39:03.440
worried it might delay
tomorrow's memorial rite.

39:09.280 --> 39:11.600
My lady, this is the ceremonial robe.

39:27.200 --> 39:28.000
My lord.

39:36.200 --> 39:37.120
Let's get inside.

39:50.200 --> 39:52.920
WEI

40:04.400 --> 40:06.400
SPIRIT TABLET
OF THE LATE LORD WEI SHANG

40:13.320 --> 40:16.360
Cleanse your hands.

40:19.040 --> 40:21.320
Offer incense to the spirits.

40:30.280 --> 40:32.240
SPIRIT TABLET OF THE LATE LORD WEI LUN

40:51.960 --> 40:52.800
Grandfather.

40:53.560 --> 40:54.320
Father.

40:55.680 --> 40:56.520
Brother.

41:03.840 --> 41:05.000
This is Lady Qiao,

41:05.800 --> 41:06.680
my wife.

41:09.840 --> 41:13.840
SPIRIT TABLET OF THE LATE LORD WEI LUN

41:13.920 --> 41:17.120
SPIRIT TABLET
OF THE LATE LORD WEI JING

41:17.200 --> 41:21.160
SPIRIT TABLET OF WEI BAO
MY LATE BROTHER
